# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, on Windows too. Tests compare files byte for byte (the agent API
# manifest, shared routes, the update manifests); a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf turned them to CRLF and eight
# tests failed there (Windows 11, 22 Nov 2026, staging c772f210). Git still detects binaries and leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored third-party trees keep the bytes they came with.
unbrowse-settlement/lib/** -text
